<h2 id="exercises-section-final-exam-fall-2013" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="09TV">111.56</span> Schemes, Final Exam, Fall 2013</h2>

<p>
These were the questions in the final exam of a course on Commutative Algebra, in the Fall of 2013 at Columbia University. 
</p>
